fks|n|A thing of the same rank with another thing; one two or more persons or things of equal rank, authority, or importance. ; Lines, or other elements of reference, by means of which the position of any point, as of a curve, is defined with respect to certain fixed lines, or planes, called coordinate axes and coordinate planes. See Abscissa.	N:20f9,59,5~20f9,59,5
