g87|n|That which joins or links two things together; a bond or tie; a coupler. ; Two of the same kind connected or considered together; a pair; a brace. ; A male and female associated together; esp., a man and woman who are married or betrothed. ; See Couple-close. ; One of the pairs of plates of two metals which compose a voltaic battery; -- called a voltaic couple or galvanic couple. ; Two rotations, movements, etc., which are equal in amount but opposite in direction, and acting along parallel lines or around parallel axes.	a:15bd,54,5;rwe,33,6~rwe,33,6;15bd,54,5	n:1ke,25,3~1ke,25,3	N:yko,69,5;22d8,53,5~yko,69,5;22d8,53,5
